    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/8a6ce7240c82d71518dc6cfb77a859db.avif?t=1747085961\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overdawn</strong> is a fast-paced, bullet-time, bullet-hell shooter set in a world on the brink of collapse. Play as one of the Chosen Ones\u2014sent into the past to stop the fall of Andrean. Fight through waves of enemies with razor-sharp gunplay, uncover buried truths, and explore a stunning 2.5D world brought to life with style and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/d684baf5d750370a288c09eb149a52d1.avif?t=1747085961\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bullet Hell + Bullet Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge through storms of enemy fire while slowing time to land the perfect headshot. Precision isn\u2019t a luxury\u2014it\u2019s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Dialogues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>dynamic conversations</strong> where every word matters. Dialogue shapes your path as you uncover the truth behind Andrean\u2019s downfall. Text comes to life with emotion as you connect with allies, confront enemies, and push forward to the very end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cool 2.5D World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted 2.5D world filled with dramatic set pieces and visual storytelling. From war-torn cities to forgotten ruins, every environment pulls you deeper into the fall of Andrean\u2014stylized, immersive, and made to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/e12312b3a76836df6a3ea04653a60d0f.avif?t=1747085961\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a small indie team with a big love for games\u2014and <strong>Overdawn</strong> is the game we\u2019ve always wanted to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Youngje</strong> began development in Unity over two years ago, and since then, he and the current team have expanded and refined it. From late-night bug fixes to hand-crafting every scene, we\u2019ve poured our hearts into this project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s been a wild ride, and we\u2019re so excited to finally share it with you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/8a6ce7240c82d71518dc6cfb77a859db.avif?t=1747085961\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overdawn</strong> is a fast-paced, bullet-time, bullet-hell shooter set in a world on the brink of collapse. Play as one of the Chosen Ones\u2014sent into the past to stop the fall of Andrean. Fight through waves of enemies with razor-sharp gunplay, uncover buried truths, and explore a stunning 2.5D world brought to life with style and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/d684baf5d750370a288c09eb149a52d1.avif?t=1747085961\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bullet Hell + Bullet Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge through storms of enemy fire while slowing time to land the perfect headshot. Precision isn\u2019t a luxury\u2014it\u2019s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Dialogues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>dynamic conversations</strong> where every word matters. Dialogue shapes your path as you uncover the truth behind Andrean\u2019s downfall. Text comes to life with emotion as you connect with allies, confront enemies, and push forward to the very end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cool 2.5D World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted 2.5D world filled with dramatic set pieces and visual storytelling. From war-torn cities to forgotten ruins, every environment pulls you deeper into the fall of Andrean\u2014stylized, immersive, and made to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/e12312b3a76836df6a3ea04653a60d0f.avif?t=1747085961\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a small indie team with a big love for games\u2014and <strong>Overdawn</strong> is the game we\u2019ve always wanted to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Youngje</strong> began development in Unity over two years ago, and since then, he and the current team have expanded and refined it. From late-night bug fixes to hand-crafting every scene, we\u2019ve poured our hearts into this project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s been a wild ride, and we\u2019re so excited to finally share it with you.</p>",
    "short_description": "Overdawn is a 2.5D, bullet hell, bullet time shooter set in a dystopian city of Andrean. As a blood-thirst merc, hunt down your enemies and defy against your destiny. Now\u2014lock in. Slow time and find your flow state. Punch a hole in your enemy\u2019s head\u2014because it\u2019s you or them.",
